      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_6_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about The 3Rs Greener School Project in Every Classroom and its application in green classroom.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes colour-coded recycling bins and enables humans to practice reducing plastic bags.\nAlex: Does it also improve sorting scrap paper?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating stainless steel flask.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in green classroom will rely on colour-coded recycling bins to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating stainless steel flask proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "The 3Rs Greener School Project in Every Classroom represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within green classroom, this initiative demonstrates how colour-coded recycling bins and sorting scrap paper can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt reducing plastic bags report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded stainless steel flask to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in green classroom will rely on colour-coded recycling bins to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating stainless steel flask proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe 3Rs Greener School Project in Every Classroom represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within green classroom, this initiative demonstrates how colour-coded recycling bins and sorting scrap paper can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt reducing plastic bags report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded stainless steel flask to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of green classroom; How colour-coded recycling bins helps daily life; Why protecting stainless steel flask is important; Your hopes for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "The 3Rs Greener School Project in Every Classroom offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in green classroom, it harnesses colour-coded recycling bins to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing reducing plastic bags teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating stainless steel flask ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
