      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Futuristic Underwater Houses in Ocean Cities and its application in ocean dome.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes pressure-resistant glass and enables humans to practice swimming with dolphins.\nAlex: Does it also improve observing marine coral?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating tidal turbine generator.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in ocean dome will rely on pressure-resistant glass to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating tidal turbine generator proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Futuristic Underwater Houses in Ocean Cities represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within ocean dome, this initiative demonstrates how pressure-resistant glass and observing marine coral can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt swimming with dolphins report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded tidal turbine generator to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in ocean dome will rely on pressure-resistant glass to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating tidal turbine generator proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nFuturistic Underwater Houses in Ocean Cities represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within ocean dome, this initiative demonstrates how pressure-resistant glass and observing marine coral can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt swimming with dolphins report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded tidal turbine generator to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of ocean dome; How pressure-resistant glass helps daily life; Why protecting tidal turbine generator is important; Your hopes for the future.",
