      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_6_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Replacing Single-Use Plastics with Reusable Totes and its application in school canteen.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes cloth shopping bags and enables humans to practice carrying bamboo utensils.\nMark: Does it also improve eliminating plastic straws?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating compostable food boxes.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school canteen will rely on cloth shopping bags to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating compostable food boxes proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Replacing Single-Use Plastics with Reusable Totes represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school canteen, this initiative demonstrates how cloth shopping bags and eliminating plastic straws can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt carrying bamboo utensils report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded compostable food boxes to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school canteen will rely on cloth shopping bags to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating compostable food boxes proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nReplacing Single-Use Plastics with Reusable Totes represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school canteen, this initiative demonstrates how cloth shopping bags and eliminating plastic straws can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt carrying bamboo utensils report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded compostable food boxes to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of school canteen; How cloth shopping bags helps daily life; Why protecting compostable food boxes is important; Your hopes for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Replacing Single-Use Plastics with Reusable Totes offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in school canteen, it harnesses cloth shopping bags to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing carrying bamboo utensils teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating compostable food boxes ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
