      "sampleWritingText": "Doctor Robots Assisting in Hospital Surgeries offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in smart hospital, it harnesses precision laser arms to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing sanitizing operating rooms teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating medical AI database ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
