      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Flying Solar-Powered Houses Traveling the World and its application in sky cruiser home.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes lightweight solar wings and enables humans to practice adjusting flight altitude.\nMark: Does it also improve floating above clouds?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating clean wind propellors.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in sky cruiser home will rely on lightweight solar wings to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating clean wind propellors proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Flying Solar-Powered Houses Traveling the World represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within sky cruiser home, this initiative demonstrates how lightweight solar wings and floating above clouds can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt adjusting flight altitude report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded clean wind propellors to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in sky cruiser home will rely on lightweight solar wings to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating clean wind propellors proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nFlying Solar-Powered Houses Traveling the World represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within sky cruiser home, this initiative demonstrates how lightweight solar wings and floating above clouds can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt adjusting flight altitude report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded clean wind propellors to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
