      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Planting Mini Herb Gardens on Apartment Balconies and its application in apartment balcony.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes wooden planter boxes and enables humans to practice watering green saplings.\nAlex: Does it also improve fresh basil and mint?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating organic compost soil.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in apartment balcony will rely on wooden planter boxes to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating organic compost soil proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Planting Mini Herb Gardens on Apartment Balconies represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within apartment balcony, this initiative demonstrates how wooden planter boxes and fresh basil and mint can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt watering green saplings report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded organic compost soil to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in apartment balcony will rely on wooden planter boxes to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating organic compost soil proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nPlanting Mini Herb Gardens on Apartment Balconies represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within apartment balcony, this initiative demonstrates how wooden planter boxes and fresh basil and mint can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt watering green saplings report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded organic compost soil to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of apartment balcony; How wooden planter boxes helps daily life; Why protecting organic compost soil is important; Your hopes for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Planting Mini Herb Gardens on Apartment Balconies offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in apartment balcony, it harnesses wooden planter boxes to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing watering green saplings teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating organic compost soil ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
