      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Humanoid Teaching Assistant Robots in English Classes and its application in language laboratory.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes pronunciation correction screen and enables humans to practice conversing with students.\nMark: Does it also improve interactive vocabulary games?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating multilingual speech system.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in language laboratory will rely on pronunciation correction screen to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating multilingual speech system proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Humanoid Teaching Assistant Robots in English Classes represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within language laboratory, this initiative demonstrates how pronunciation correction screen and interactive vocabulary games can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt conversing with students report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded multilingual speech system to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in language laboratory will rely on pronunciation correction screen to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating multilingual speech system proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHumanoid Teaching Assistant Robots in English Classes represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within language laboratory, this initiative demonstrates how pronunciation correction screen and interactive vocabulary games can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt conversing with students report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded multilingual speech system to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of language laboratory; How pronunciation correction screen helps daily life; Why protecting multilingual speech system is important; Your hopes for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Humanoid Teaching Assistant Robots in English Classes offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in language laboratory, it harnesses pronunciation correction screen to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing conversing with students teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating multilingual speech system ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
