      "schoolName": "TRƯỜNG THCS ĐỒNG YÊN",
      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_6_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Rescue Robots Searching Collapsed Buildings and its application in disaster rescue center.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes flexible crawler tracks and enables humans to practice detecting trapped survivors.\nAlex: Does it also improve infrared thermal camera?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating two-way audio speaker.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in disaster rescue center will rely on flexible crawler tracks to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating two-way audio speaker proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Rescue Robots Searching Collapsed Buildings represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within disaster rescue center, this initiative demonstrates how flexible crawler tracks and infrared thermal camera can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt detecting trapped survivors report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded two-way audio speaker to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in disaster rescue center will rely on flexible crawler tracks to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating two-way audio speaker proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nRescue Robots Searching Collapsed Buildings represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within disaster rescue center, this initiative demonstrates how flexible crawler tracks and infrared thermal camera can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt detecting trapped survivors report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded two-way audio speaker to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of disaster rescue center; How flexible crawler tracks helps daily life; Why protecting two-way audio speaker is important; Your hopes for the future.",
