      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Super-Smart Appliances Ordering Fresh Food Automatically and its application in connected kitchen.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes smart refrigerator display and enables humans to practice baking nutritious meals.\nMark: Does it also improve automatic grocery inventory?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating low-energy sensor.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in connected kitchen will rely on smart refrigerator display to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating low-energy sensor proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Super-Smart Appliances Ordering Fresh Food Automatically represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within connected kitchen, this initiative demonstrates how smart refrigerator display and automatic grocery inventory can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt baking nutritious meals report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded low-energy sensor to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in connected kitchen will rely on smart refrigerator display to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating low-energy sensor proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSuper-Smart Appliances Ordering Fresh Food Automatically represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within connected kitchen, this initiative demonstrates how smart refrigerator display and automatic grocery inventory can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt baking nutritious meals report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded low-energy sensor to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of connected kitchen; How smart refrigerator display helps daily life; Why protecting low-energy sensor is important; Your hopes for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Super-Smart Appliances Ordering Fresh Food Automatically offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in connected kitchen, it harnesses smart refrigerator display to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing baking nutritious meals teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating low-energy sensor ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
