      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Guard Robots Patrolling School Grounds at Night and its application in school perimeter.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes night-vision cameras and enables humans to practice patrolling dark pathways.\nMark: Does it also improve alerting security guards?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating solar charging dock.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school perimeter will rely on night-vision cameras to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating solar charging dock proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Guard Robots Patrolling School Grounds at Night represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school perimeter, this initiative demonstrates how night-vision cameras and alerting security guards can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt patrolling dark pathways report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded solar charging dock to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school perimeter will rely on night-vision cameras to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating solar charging dock proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nGuard Robots Patrolling School Grounds at Night represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school perimeter, this initiative demonstrates how night-vision cameras and alerting security guards can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt patrolling dark pathways report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded solar charging dock to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of school perimeter; How night-vision cameras helps daily life; Why protecting solar charging dock is important; Your hopes for the future.",
