      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Robotic Exploration Rovers on the Surface of Mars and its application in Mars exploration station.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes robotic sample drill and enables humans to practice broadcasting high-resolution photos.\nAlex: Does it also improve analyzing red soil rocks?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating radioisotope battery.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in Mars exploration station will rely on robotic sample drill to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating radioisotope battery proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Robotic Exploration Rovers on the Surface of Mars represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within Mars exploration station, this initiative demonstrates how robotic sample drill and analyzing red soil rocks can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt broadcasting high-resolution photos report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded radioisotope battery to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in Mars exploration station will rely on robotic sample drill to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating radioisotope battery proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nRobotic Exploration Rovers on the Surface of Mars represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within Mars exploration station, this initiative demonstrates how robotic sample drill and analyzing red soil rocks can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt broadcasting high-resolution photos report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded radioisotope battery to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
