      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Hyperloop High-Speed Vacuum Train Networks related to futuristic transit tube.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by magnetic levitation pods and love riding high-speed hyperloop.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses supersonic passenger transit and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of pneumatic tube station.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In futuristic transit tube, engineers are utilizing magnetic levitation pods to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing pneumatic tube station guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Hyperloop High-Speed Vacuum Train Networks represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in futuristic transit tube. By utilizing magnetic levitation pods and supersonic passenger transit, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test riding high-speed hyperloop report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize pneumatic tube station as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In futuristic transit tube, engineers are utilizing magnetic levitation pods to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing pneumatic tube station guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHyperloop High-Speed Vacuum Train Networks represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in futuristic transit tube. By utilizing magnetic levitation pods and supersonic passenger transit, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test riding high-speed hyperloop report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize pneumatic tube station as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
