      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Canada - Rocky Mountains, Maple Syrup, and Wildlife related to Vancouver and Rockies.\nMark: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nHoa: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by majestic snowcapped peaks and love tasting maple syrup pancakes.\nMark: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nHoa: It harnesses crisp bilingual culture and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of grizzly bear sanctuary.\nMark: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Vancouver and Rockies, engineers are utilizing majestic snowcapped peaks to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing grizzly bear sanctuary guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Canada - Rocky Mountains, Maple Syrup, and Wildlife represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Vancouver and Rockies. By utilizing majestic snowcapped peaks and crisp bilingual culture, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test tasting maple syrup pancakes report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize grizzly bear sanctuary as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
