      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Wind Turbine Farms on Coastal Hills and Islands related to Binh Thuan wind farm.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by towering white wind turbines and love harnessing coastal winds.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses renewable oceanic breezes and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of electrical power substation.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Binh Thuan wind farm, engineers are utilizing towering white wind turbines to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing electrical power substation guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Wind Turbine Farms on Coastal Hills and Islands represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Binh Thuan wind farm. By utilizing towering white wind turbines and renewable oceanic breezes, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test harnessing coastal winds report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize electrical power substation as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Binh Thuan wind farm, engineers are utilizing towering white wind turbines to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing electrical power substation guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nWind Turbine Farms on Coastal Hills and Islands represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Binh Thuan wind farm. By utilizing towering white wind turbines and renewable oceanic breezes, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test harnessing coastal winds report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize electrical power substation as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of Binh Thuan wind farm; How towering white wind turbines provides clean benefits; Why electrical power substation matters; Your vision for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Wind Turbine Farms on Coastal Hills and Islands represents an inspiring breakthrough for humankind. Situated in Binh Thuan wind farm, it harnesses towering white wind turbines to protect our precious environment. Experiencing harnessing coastal winds demonstrates how modern science can provide clean alternatives to fossil fuels. In addition, developing electrical power substation will foster international cooperation with English-speaking countries. I look forward to living in such a sustainable future.",
