      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Personal Sky Pods and Automated Driverless Cars related to eco-smart highway.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by collision-avoidance sensors and love commuting in automated pods.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses silent electric batteries and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of smart solar charging lane.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In eco-smart highway, engineers are utilizing collision-avoidance sensors to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing smart solar charging lane guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Personal Sky Pods and Automated Driverless Cars represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in eco-smart highway. By utilizing collision-avoidance sensors and silent electric batteries, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test commuting in automated pods report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize smart solar charging lane as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In eco-smart highway, engineers are utilizing collision-avoidance sensors to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing smart solar charging lane guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nPersonal Sky Pods and Automated Driverless Cars represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in eco-smart highway. By utilizing collision-avoidance sensors and silent electric batteries, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test commuting in automated pods report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize smart solar charging lane as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of eco-smart highway; How collision-avoidance sensors provides clean benefits; Why smart solar charging lane matters; Your vision for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Personal Sky Pods and Automated Driverless Cars represents an inspiring breakthrough for humankind. Situated in eco-smart highway, it harnesses collision-avoidance sensors to protect our precious environment. Experiencing commuting in automated pods demonstrates how modern science can provide clean alternatives to fossil fuels. In addition, developing smart solar charging lane will foster international cooperation with English-speaking countries. I look forward to living in such a sustainable future.",
