      "durationMinutes": 60,
      "schoolName": "TRƯỜNG THCS ĐỒNG YÊN",
      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Biomass Energy Production from Agricultural Waste related to rural cooperative.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by organic rice husk fuel and love recycling agricultural straw.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses smokeless clean cookstoves and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of biogas digestor tank.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In rural cooperative, engineers are utilizing organic rice husk fuel to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing biogas digestor tank guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Biomass Energy Production from Agricultural Waste represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in rural cooperative. By utilizing organic rice husk fuel and smokeless clean cookstoves, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test recycling agricultural straw report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize biogas digestor tank as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In rural cooperative, engineers are utilizing organic rice husk fuel to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing biogas digestor tank guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBiomass Energy Production from Agricultural Waste represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in rural cooperative. By utilizing organic rice husk fuel and smokeless clean cookstoves, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test recycling agricultural straw report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize biogas digestor tank as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of rural cooperative; How organic rice husk fuel provides clean benefits; Why biogas digestor tank matters; Your vision for the future.",
