      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Electric High-Speed Monorails for Green Cities related to metropolitan monorail.\nMark: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nHoa: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by single elevated track and love gliding above city parks.\nMark: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nHoa: It harnesses zero exhaust emissions and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of automatic ticket barrier.\nMark: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In metropolitan monorail, engineers are utilizing single elevated track to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing automatic ticket barrier guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Electric High-Speed Monorails for Green Cities represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in metropolitan monorail. By utilizing single elevated track and zero exhaust emissions, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test gliding above city parks report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize automatic ticket barrier as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In metropolitan monorail, engineers are utilizing single elevated track to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing automatic ticket barrier guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nElectric High-Speed Monorails for Green Cities represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in metropolitan monorail. By utilizing single elevated track and zero exhaust emissions, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test gliding above city parks report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize automatic ticket barrier as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
