      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Ocean Wave and Tidal Stream Energy Turbines related to coastal marine plant.\nMark: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nHoa: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by submerged tidal propellers and love generating marine electricity.\nMark: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nHoa: It harnesses predictable ocean tides and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of underwater power cable.\nMark: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In coastal marine plant, engineers are utilizing submerged tidal propellers to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing underwater power cable guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Ocean Wave and Tidal Stream Energy Turbines represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in coastal marine plant. By utilizing submerged tidal propellers and predictable ocean tides, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test generating marine electricity report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize underwater power cable as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In coastal marine plant, engineers are utilizing submerged tidal propellers to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing underwater power cable guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nOcean Wave and Tidal Stream Energy Turbines represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in coastal marine plant. By utilizing submerged tidal propellers and predictable ocean tides, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test generating marine electricity report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize underwater power cable as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
