      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Hydrogen Fuel Cell Buses for Urban Commuting related to green city transit depot.\nMark: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nHoa: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by zero-emission water exhaust and love riding clean city buses.\nMark: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nHoa: It harnesses rapid hydrogen refueling and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of hydrogen fuel station.\nMark: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In green city transit depot, engineers are utilizing zero-emission water exhaust to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing hydrogen fuel station guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Hydrogen Fuel Cell Buses for Urban Commuting represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in green city transit depot. By utilizing zero-emission water exhaust and rapid hydrogen refueling, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test riding clean city buses report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize hydrogen fuel station as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In green city transit depot, engineers are utilizing zero-emission water exhaust to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing hydrogen fuel station guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHydrogen Fuel Cell Buses for Urban Commuting represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in green city transit depot. By utilizing zero-emission water exhaust and rapid hydrogen refueling, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test riding clean city buses report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize hydrogen fuel station as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of green city transit depot; How zero-emission water exhaust provides clean benefits; Why hydrogen fuel station matters; Your vision for the future.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Hydrogen Fuel Cell Buses for Urban Commuting represents an inspiring breakthrough for humankind. Situated in green city transit depot, it harnesses zero-emission water exhaust to protect our precious environment. Experiencing riding clean city buses demonstrates how modern science can provide clean alternatives to fossil fuels. In addition, developing hydrogen fuel station will foster international cooperation with English-speaking countries. I look forward to living in such a sustainable future.",
