      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Searching for Biosignatures on Exoplanets with James Webb at astrophysics observatory.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by deep infrared spectrometers and eager to test identifying habitable exoplanets.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances atmospheric gas biosignatures and relies on the groundbreaking precision of deep space mirror array.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In astrophysics observatory, scientists are developing deep infrared spectrometers to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice identifying habitable exoplanets with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering atmospheric gas biosignatures expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering deep space mirror array will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Searching for Biosignatures on Exoplanets with James Webb stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in astrophysics observatory. By combining deep infrared spectrometers with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in atmospheric gas biosignatures. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving identifying habitable exoplanets have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight deep space mirror array as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In astrophysics observatory, scientists are developing deep infrared spectrometers to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice identifying habitable exoplanets with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering atmospheric gas biosignatures expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering deep space mirror array will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSearching for Biosignatures on Exoplanets with James Webb stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in astrophysics observatory. By combining deep infrared spectrometers with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in atmospheric gas biosignatures. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving identifying habitable exoplanets have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight deep space mirror array as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in astrophysics observatory; Key features like deep infrared spectrometers; Practical benefits like identifying habitable exoplanets; Importance of deep space mirror array.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Searching for Biosignatures on Exoplanets with James Webb represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in astrophysics observatory, it harnesses deep infrared spectrometers to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice identifying habitable exoplanets expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of deep space mirror array paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
