      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Real-Time Translation Earbuds Eliminating Language Barriers at international conference.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by multi-dialect speech translation and eager to test conversing across foreign languages.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances sub-second acoustic processing and relies on the groundbreaking precision of smart micro-speaker earbud.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In international conference, scientists are developing multi-dialect speech translation to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice conversing across foreign languages with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering sub-second acoustic processing expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering smart micro-speaker earbud will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Real-Time Translation Earbuds Eliminating Language Barriers stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in international conference. By combining multi-dialect speech translation with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in sub-second acoustic processing. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving conversing across foreign languages have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight smart micro-speaker earbud as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In international conference, scientists are developing multi-dialect speech translation to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice conversing across foreign languages with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering sub-second acoustic processing expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering smart micro-speaker earbud will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nReal-Time Translation Earbuds Eliminating Language Barriers stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in international conference. By combining multi-dialect speech translation with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in sub-second acoustic processing. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving conversing across foreign languages have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight smart micro-speaker earbud as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in international conference; Key features like multi-dialect speech translation; Practical benefits like conversing across foreign languages; Importance of smart micro-speaker earbud.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Real-Time Translation Earbuds Eliminating Language Barriers represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in international conference, it harnesses multi-dialect speech translation to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice conversing across foreign languages expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of smart micro-speaker earbud paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
