      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Terraforming Mars: Constructing Pressurized Biodomes at Martian colony base.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by heavy radiation-shielded domes and eager to test harvesting frozen polar ice.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances oxygen-generating algae tanks and relies on the groundbreaking precision of planetary rover tractor.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In Martian colony base, scientists are developing heavy radiation-shielded domes to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice harvesting frozen polar ice with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering oxygen-generating algae tanks expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering planetary rover tractor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Terraforming Mars: Constructing Pressurized Biodomes stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in Martian colony base. By combining heavy radiation-shielded domes with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in oxygen-generating algae tanks. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving harvesting frozen polar ice have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight planetary rover tractor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In Martian colony base, scientists are developing heavy radiation-shielded domes to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice harvesting frozen polar ice with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering oxygen-generating algae tanks expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering planetary rover tractor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTerraforming Mars: Constructing Pressurized Biodomes stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in Martian colony base. By combining heavy radiation-shielded domes with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in oxygen-generating algae tanks. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving harvesting frozen polar ice have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight planetary rover tractor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in Martian colony base; Key features like heavy radiation-shielded domes; Practical benefits like harvesting frozen polar ice; Importance of planetary rover tractor.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Terraforming Mars: Constructing Pressurized Biodomes represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in Martian colony base, it harnesses heavy radiation-shielded domes to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice harvesting frozen polar ice expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of planetary rover tractor paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
