      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Quantum Computing Solving Complex Climate Models at quantum supercomputing hub.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by superconducting quantum qubits and eager to test predicting global climate shifts.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances simulating atmospheric dynamics and relies on the groundbreaking precision of cryogenic cooling chamber.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In quantum supercomputing hub, scientists are developing superconducting quantum qubits to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice predicting global climate shifts with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering simulating atmospheric dynamics expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering cryogenic cooling chamber will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Quantum Computing Solving Complex Climate Models stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in quantum supercomputing hub. By combining superconducting quantum qubits with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in simulating atmospheric dynamics. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving predicting global climate shifts have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight cryogenic cooling chamber as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In quantum supercomputing hub, scientists are developing superconducting quantum qubits to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice predicting global climate shifts with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering simulating atmospheric dynamics expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering cryogenic cooling chamber will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nQuantum Computing Solving Complex Climate Models stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in quantum supercomputing hub. By combining superconducting quantum qubits with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in simulating atmospheric dynamics. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving predicting global climate shifts have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight cryogenic cooling chamber as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in quantum supercomputing hub; Key features like superconducting quantum qubits; Practical benefits like predicting global climate shifts; Importance of cryogenic cooling chamber.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Quantum Computing Solving Complex Climate Models represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in quantum supercomputing hub, it harnesses superconducting quantum qubits to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice predicting global climate shifts expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of cryogenic cooling chamber paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
