      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Smart Contact Lenses with Augmented Reality Overlays at optometry tech center.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by transparent micro-LED displays and eager to test accessing information hands-free.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances real-time digital navigation arrows and relies on the groundbreaking precision of biometric iris scanner.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In optometry tech center, scientists are developing transparent micro-LED displays to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice accessing information hands-free with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering real-time digital navigation arrows expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering biometric iris scanner will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Smart Contact Lenses with Augmented Reality Overlays stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in optometry tech center. By combining transparent micro-LED displays with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in real-time digital navigation arrows. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving accessing information hands-free have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight biometric iris scanner as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In optometry tech center, scientists are developing transparent micro-LED displays to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice accessing information hands-free with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering real-time digital navigation arrows expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering biometric iris scanner will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSmart Contact Lenses with Augmented Reality Overlays stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in optometry tech center. By combining transparent micro-LED displays with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in real-time digital navigation arrows. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving accessing information hands-free have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight biometric iris scanner as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in optometry tech center; Key features like transparent micro-LED displays; Practical benefits like accessing information hands-free; Importance of biometric iris scanner.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Smart Contact Lenses with Augmented Reality Overlays represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in optometry tech center, it harnesses transparent micro-LED displays to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice accessing information hands-free expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of biometric iris scanner paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
