      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about The Search for Extraterrestrial Intelligence (SETI Project) at radio telescope array.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by colossal parabolic antennas and eager to test filtering interstellar background noise.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances monitoring cosmic radio signals and relies on the groundbreaking precision of signal frequency processor.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In radio telescope array, scientists are developing colossal parabolic antennas to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice filtering interstellar background noise with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering monitoring cosmic radio signals expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering signal frequency processor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Search for Extraterrestrial Intelligence (SETI Project) stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in radio telescope array. By combining colossal parabolic antennas with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in monitoring cosmic radio signals. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving filtering interstellar background noise have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight signal frequency processor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In radio telescope array, scientists are developing colossal parabolic antennas to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice filtering interstellar background noise with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering monitoring cosmic radio signals expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering signal frequency processor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Search for Extraterrestrial Intelligence (SETI Project) stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in radio telescope array. By combining colossal parabolic antennas with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in monitoring cosmic radio signals. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving filtering interstellar background noise have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight signal frequency processor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in radio telescope array; Key features like colossal parabolic antennas; Practical benefits like filtering interstellar background noise; Importance of signal frequency processor.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, The Search for Extraterrestrial Intelligence (SETI Project) represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in radio telescope array, it harnesses colossal parabolic antennas to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice filtering interstellar background noise expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of signal frequency processor paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
