          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about The Search for Extraterrestrial Intelligence (SETI Project).\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Setting in radio telescope array; Key features like colossal parabolic antennas; Practical benefits like filtering interstellar background noise; Importance of signal frequency processor.",
