      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Gene Editing with CRISPR to Eradicate Hereditary Illnesses at genetic research institute.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by molecular DNA cutting scissors and eager to test treating inherited genetic disorders.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances repairing mutated genetic sequences and relies on the groundbreaking precision of gene sequencing sequencer.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In genetic research institute, scientists are developing molecular DNA cutting scissors to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice treating inherited genetic disorders with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering repairing mutated genetic sequences expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering gene sequencing sequencer will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Gene Editing with CRISPR to Eradicate Hereditary Illnesses stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in genetic research institute. By combining molecular DNA cutting scissors with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in repairing mutated genetic sequences. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving treating inherited genetic disorders have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight gene sequencing sequencer as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In genetic research institute, scientists are developing molecular DNA cutting scissors to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice treating inherited genetic disorders with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering repairing mutated genetic sequences expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering gene sequencing sequencer will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nGene Editing with CRISPR to Eradicate Hereditary Illnesses stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in genetic research institute. By combining molecular DNA cutting scissors with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in repairing mutated genetic sequences. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving treating inherited genetic disorders have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight gene sequencing sequencer as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
