      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Space Elevator Concepts Connecting Earth to Orbital Stations at orbital launch tether.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by super-strong carbon nanotube cables and eager to test transporting cargo to orbit.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances climber cars powered by laser and relies on the groundbreaking precision of geostationary counterweight anchor.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In orbital launch tether, scientists are developing super-strong carbon nanotube cables to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice transporting cargo to orbit with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering climber cars powered by laser expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering geostationary counterweight anchor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Space Elevator Concepts Connecting Earth to Orbital Stations stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in orbital launch tether. By combining super-strong carbon nanotube cables with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in climber cars powered by laser. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving transporting cargo to orbit have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight geostationary counterweight anchor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In orbital launch tether, scientists are developing super-strong carbon nanotube cables to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice transporting cargo to orbit with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering climber cars powered by laser expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering geostationary counterweight anchor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSpace Elevator Concepts Connecting Earth to Orbital Stations stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in orbital launch tether. By combining super-strong carbon nanotube cables with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in climber cars powered by laser. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving transporting cargo to orbit have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight geostationary counterweight anchor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in orbital launch tether; Key features like super-strong carbon nanotube cables; Practical benefits like transporting cargo to orbit; Importance of geostationary counterweight anchor.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Space Elevator Concepts Connecting Earth to Orbital Stations represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in orbital launch tether, it harnesses super-strong carbon nanotube cables to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice transporting cargo to orbit expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of geostationary counterweight anchor paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
