      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Autonomous Agricultural Drone Swarms Managing Crop Health at smart agricultural estate.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by multispectral crop cameras and eager to test monitoring soil moisture levels.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances pinpoint organic pest control and relies on the groundbreaking precision of drone solar recharging pad.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In smart agricultural estate, scientists are developing multispectral crop cameras to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice monitoring soil moisture levels with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering pinpoint organic pest control expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering drone solar recharging pad will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Autonomous Agricultural Drone Swarms Managing Crop Health stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in smart agricultural estate. By combining multispectral crop cameras with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in pinpoint organic pest control. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving monitoring soil moisture levels have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight drone solar recharging pad as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In smart agricultural estate, scientists are developing multispectral crop cameras to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice monitoring soil moisture levels with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering pinpoint organic pest control expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering drone solar recharging pad will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAutonomous Agricultural Drone Swarms Managing Crop Health stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in smart agricultural estate. By combining multispectral crop cameras with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in pinpoint organic pest control. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving monitoring soil moisture levels have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight drone solar recharging pad as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Setting in smart agricultural estate; Key features like multispectral crop cameras; Practical benefits like monitoring soil moisture levels; Importance of drone solar recharging pad.",
