      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Smart Digital Classrooms: Tablets and Collaborative Learning at secondary smart classroom.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by cloud-connected digital tablets and eager to explore collaborating on online science projects.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on interactive virtual whiteboard screens and underscores the significance of digital pedagogical software.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In secondary smart classroom, researchers and career advisors utilize cloud-connected digital tablets to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in collaborating on online science projects, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of interactive virtual whiteboard screens reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating digital pedagogical software will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Smart Digital Classrooms: Tablets and Collaborative Learning stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in secondary smart classroom. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, cloud-connected digital tablets and interactive virtual whiteboard screens offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to collaborating on online science projects report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight digital pedagogical software as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In secondary smart classroom, researchers and career advisors utilize cloud-connected digital tablets to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in collaborating on online science projects, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of interactive virtual whiteboard screens reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating digital pedagogical software will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSmart Digital Classrooms: Tablets and Collaborative Learning stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in secondary smart classroom. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, cloud-connected digital tablets and interactive virtual whiteboard screens offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to collaborating on online science projects report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight digital pedagogical software as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in secondary smart classroom; Key factors like cloud-connected digital tablets; Recommended activities like collaborating on online science projects; Role of digital pedagogical software in future careers.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Smart Digital Classrooms: Tablets and Collaborative Learning offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In secondary smart classroom, it harnesses cloud-connected digital tablets to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in collaborating on online science projects nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering digital pedagogical software is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
