      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Renewable Energy Engineering: Designing Offshore Wind Turbines at coastal engineering academy.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by towering offshore turbine foundations and eager to explore testing wind energy efficiency.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on aerodynamic composite turbine blades and underscores the significance of renewable energy engineer.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In coastal engineering academy, researchers and career advisors utilize towering offshore turbine foundations to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in testing wind energy efficiency, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of aerodynamic composite turbine blades reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating renewable energy engineer will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Renewable Energy Engineering: Designing Offshore Wind Turbines stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in coastal engineering academy. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, towering offshore turbine foundations and aerodynamic composite turbine blades offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to testing wind energy efficiency report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight renewable energy engineer as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In coastal engineering academy, researchers and career advisors utilize towering offshore turbine foundations to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in testing wind energy efficiency, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of aerodynamic composite turbine blades reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating renewable energy engineer will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nRenewable Energy Engineering: Designing Offshore Wind Turbines stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in coastal engineering academy. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, towering offshore turbine foundations and aerodynamic composite turbine blades offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to testing wind energy efficiency report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight renewable energy engineer as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in coastal engineering academy; Key factors like towering offshore turbine foundations; Recommended activities like testing wind energy efficiency; Role of renewable energy engineer in future careers.",
