      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Digital Privacy, Cybersecurity, and Safeguarding Personal Data at cybersecurity defense lab.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by two-factor cryptographic authentication and eager to explore preventing malicious cyber attacks.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on encrypting sensitive student records and underscores the significance of ethical cybersecurity analyst.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In cybersecurity defense lab, researchers and career advisors utilize two-factor cryptographic authentication to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in preventing malicious cyber attacks, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of encrypting sensitive student records reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating ethical cybersecurity analyst will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Digital Privacy, Cybersecurity, and Safeguarding Personal Data stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in cybersecurity defense lab. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, two-factor cryptographic authentication and encrypting sensitive student records offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to preventing malicious cyber attacks report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight ethical cybersecurity analyst as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In cybersecurity defense lab, researchers and career advisors utilize two-factor cryptographic authentication to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in preventing malicious cyber attacks, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of encrypting sensitive student records reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating ethical cybersecurity analyst will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nDigital Privacy, Cybersecurity, and Safeguarding Personal Data stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in cybersecurity defense lab. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, two-factor cryptographic authentication and encrypting sensitive student records offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to preventing malicious cyber attacks report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight ethical cybersecurity analyst as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in cybersecurity defense lab; Key factors like two-factor cryptographic authentication; Recommended activities like preventing malicious cyber attacks; Role of ethical cybersecurity analyst in future careers.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Digital Privacy, Cybersecurity, and Safeguarding Personal Data offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In cybersecurity defense lab, it harnesses two-factor cryptographic authentication to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in preventing malicious cyber attacks nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering ethical cybersecurity analyst is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
