          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Digital Privacy, Cybersecurity, and Safeguarding Personal Data.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Context in cybersecurity defense lab; Key factors like two-factor cryptographic authentication; Recommended activities like preventing malicious cyber attacks; Role of ethical cybersecurity analyst in future careers.",
