      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about The Colonization of Mars: Biospheres, Water, and Logistics at planetary science institute.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by pressurized Martian agricultural biodomes and eager to explore simulating life in Martian habitats.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on extracting water from polar subsoil and underscores the significance of planetary colonization rover.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In planetary science institute, researchers and career advisors utilize pressurized Martian agricultural biodomes to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in simulating life in Martian habitats, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of extracting water from polar subsoil reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating planetary colonization rover will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Colonization of Mars: Biospheres, Water, and Logistics stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in planetary science institute. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, pressurized Martian agricultural biodomes and extracting water from polar subsoil offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to simulating life in Martian habitats report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight planetary colonization rover as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In planetary science institute, researchers and career advisors utilize pressurized Martian agricultural biodomes to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in simulating life in Martian habitats, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of extracting water from polar subsoil reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating planetary colonization rover will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Colonization of Mars: Biospheres, Water, and Logistics stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in planetary science institute. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, pressurized Martian agricultural biodomes and extracting water from polar subsoil offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to simulating life in Martian habitats report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight planetary colonization rover as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in planetary science institute; Key factors like pressurized Martian agricultural biodomes; Recommended activities like simulating life in Martian habitats; Role of planetary colonization rover in future careers.",
