          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about The Colonization of Mars: Biospheres, Water, and Logistics.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Context in planetary science institute; Key factors like pressurized Martian agricultural biodomes; Recommended activities like simulating life in Martian habitats; Role of planetary colonization rover in future careers.",
