      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Green Careers: Environmental Scientists Restoring Wetlands at coastal wetland reserve.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by brackish mangrove biodiversity and eager to explore restoring degraded peat bogs.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on soil carbon sequestration analysis and underscores the significance of field conservation ecologist.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In coastal wetland reserve, researchers and career advisors utilize brackish mangrove biodiversity to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in restoring degraded peat bogs, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of soil carbon sequestration analysis reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating field conservation ecologist will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Green Careers: Environmental Scientists Restoring Wetlands stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in coastal wetland reserve. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, brackish mangrove biodiversity and soil carbon sequestration analysis offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to restoring degraded peat bogs report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight field conservation ecologist as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In coastal wetland reserve, researchers and career advisors utilize brackish mangrove biodiversity to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in restoring degraded peat bogs, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of soil carbon sequestration analysis reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating field conservation ecologist will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nGreen Careers: Environmental Scientists Restoring Wetlands stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in coastal wetland reserve. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, brackish mangrove biodiversity and soil carbon sequestration analysis offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to restoring degraded peat bogs report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight field conservation ecologist as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in coastal wetland reserve; Key factors like brackish mangrove biodiversity; Recommended activities like restoring degraded peat bogs; Role of field conservation ecologist in future careers.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Green Careers: Environmental Scientists Restoring Wetlands offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In coastal wetland reserve, it harnesses brackish mangrove biodiversity to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in restoring degraded peat bogs nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering field conservation ecologist is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
