      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about The Search for Habitable Exoplanets in Kepler's Goldilocks Zone at space telescope research center.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by transit photometry light dips and eager to explore cataloging potentially habitable worlds.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on detecting rocky planets with liquid water and underscores the significance of astrophysics data pipeline.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In space telescope research center, researchers and career advisors utilize transit photometry light dips to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in cataloging potentially habitable worlds, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of detecting rocky planets with liquid water reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating astrophysics data pipeline will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Search for Habitable Exoplanets in Kepler's Goldilocks Zone stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in space telescope research center. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, transit photometry light dips and detecting rocky planets with liquid water offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to cataloging potentially habitable worlds report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight astrophysics data pipeline as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In space telescope research center, researchers and career advisors utilize transit photometry light dips to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in cataloging potentially habitable worlds, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of detecting rocky planets with liquid water reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating astrophysics data pipeline will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Search for Habitable Exoplanets in Kepler's Goldilocks Zone stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in space telescope research center. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, transit photometry light dips and detecting rocky planets with liquid water offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to cataloging potentially habitable worlds report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight astrophysics data pipeline as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in space telescope research center; Key factors like transit photometry light dips; Recommended activities like cataloging potentially habitable worlds; Role of astrophysics data pipeline in future careers.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, The Search for Habitable Exoplanets in Kepler's Goldilocks Zone offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In space telescope research center, it harnesses transit photometry light dips to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in cataloging potentially habitable worlds nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering astrophysics data pipeline is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
