      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Interplanetary Spacecraft: Ion Propulsion and Asteroid Mining at aerospace engineering lab.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by xenon ion propulsion thrusters and eager to explore navigating autonomous deep space probes.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on targeting mineral-rich near-Earth asteroids and underscores the significance of spacecraft propulsion engineer.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In aerospace engineering lab, researchers and career advisors utilize xenon ion propulsion thrusters to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in navigating autonomous deep space probes, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of targeting mineral-rich near-Earth asteroids reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating spacecraft propulsion engineer will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Interplanetary Spacecraft: Ion Propulsion and Asteroid Mining stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in aerospace engineering lab. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, xenon ion propulsion thrusters and targeting mineral-rich near-Earth asteroids offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to navigating autonomous deep space probes report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight spacecraft propulsion engineer as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In aerospace engineering lab, researchers and career advisors utilize xenon ion propulsion thrusters to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in navigating autonomous deep space probes, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of targeting mineral-rich near-Earth asteroids reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating spacecraft propulsion engineer will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nInterplanetary Spacecraft: Ion Propulsion and Asteroid Mining stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in aerospace engineering lab. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, xenon ion propulsion thrusters and targeting mineral-rich near-Earth asteroids offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to navigating autonomous deep space probes report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight spacecraft propulsion engineer as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in aerospace engineering lab; Key factors like xenon ion propulsion thrusters; Recommended activities like navigating autonomous deep space probes; Role of spacecraft propulsion engineer in future careers.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Interplanetary Spacecraft: Ion Propulsion and Asteroid Mining offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In aerospace engineering lab, it harnesses xenon ion propulsion thrusters to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in navigating autonomous deep space probes nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering spacecraft propulsion engineer is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
