      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Astrobiology: Extremophiles Thriving in Earth's Deep Trenches at oceanographic research vessel.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by hydrothermal vent bacterial colonies and eager to explore studying extremophile DNA adaptations.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on surviving immense water pressures and underscores the significance of deep sea submersible robot.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In oceanographic research vessel, researchers and career advisors utilize hydrothermal vent bacterial colonies to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in studying extremophile DNA adaptations, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of surviving immense water pressures reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating deep sea submersible robot will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Astrobiology: Extremophiles Thriving in Earth's Deep Trenches stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in oceanographic research vessel. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, hydrothermal vent bacterial colonies and surviving immense water pressures offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to studying extremophile DNA adaptations report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight deep sea submersible robot as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In oceanographic research vessel, researchers and career advisors utilize hydrothermal vent bacterial colonies to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in studying extremophile DNA adaptations, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of surviving immense water pressures reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating deep sea submersible robot will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAstrobiology: Extremophiles Thriving in Earth's Deep Trenches stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in oceanographic research vessel. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, hydrothermal vent bacterial colonies and surviving immense water pressures offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to studying extremophile DNA adaptations report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight deep sea submersible robot as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Context in oceanographic research vessel; Key factors like hydrothermal vent bacterial colonies; Recommended activities like studying extremophile DNA adaptations; Role of deep sea submersible robot in future careers.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Astrobiology: Extremophiles Thriving in Earth's Deep Trenches offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In oceanographic research vessel, it harnesses hydrothermal vent bacterial colonies to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in studying extremophile DNA adaptations nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering deep sea submersible robot is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
